{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Do not swallow resource failures during size estimation.** `MemoryError` and `RecursionError` now become `None`, causing `truncate_record()` to accept the untruncated record and `export()` to attempt the same expensive serialization again. Keep this limited to expected serialization errors; `_export_one()` already isolates other exceptions. Add a regression ensuring a sizing resource failure does not call the exporter.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7tZZEH","finding_digest":"fd4fd3cfda1218bc75a3b44a2d2a33a24ff7e98a5a7a143d28e53bf78bf95b1c","finding_id":"arf_v1_7vh5ht62cimly5ndwrfc2krtuj","finding_key":"insight/truncation.py::json_byte_size::resource-failure-retry","identity_key":"insight/truncation.py::json_byte_size::resource-failure-retry","line":31,"observation_digest":"3da35163f6fef9fcd6b8586f0918948cfa6a68dc73bbccd2a9a4dd3858165800","observation_id":"aro_v1_hwrvcy7w7347zvvylbxqsgeurt","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-insight/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_insight/truncation.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-10T19:44:06Z","review_id":"arr_v1_264ye3dbksjwshfcb7jfp46fpr","reviewed_base_sha":"630b7771cedb1cf561e6ac29d49b84b6291db6b4","reviewed_head_sha":"41e83739297f63cef45ca9f53d20d65ec936ef9b","reviewer":"codex","start_line":31,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_tejw52r64uzxqktqy2rljroypl"},"pull_request":{"number":702},"record_id":"art_v1_n2t62muoivoep2pzamurvqn3r6","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-10T19:44:06Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
